                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "This game is a very fun game, in fact i would even go so far to call it a contender for the best game ever, as far as its genres that it combines are concerned, and the game play is really fun and can sometimes get addictive, and the fact that it combines elements of being a hybrid rhythm/racing game is utterly amazing, and the fact that it is accessible for the blind, so even visually impaired people (yes, i am also counting myself in that category); can play it. i would highly recommend this game to anyone, even though it has been quite some time since i have last played any rhythm games, and as such my rhythm is not the best, but this is always a fun game to come back too, even if it is just to try and fail on tracks in Arcade Mode on Extreme Difficulty! again, this game is highly recommended by me and others who have played it and find it fun and addicting.",
